@startuml libcpg-evidence-lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

title <b>libcpg assurance-evidence lifecycle</b>\n<size:11><i>exact publication requires every immutable binding and independent guarantee</i></size>

[*] --> Uncaptured
state Uncaptured #ECEFF1
state Captured #BBDEFB
state Analyzed #B3E5FC
state Guaranteed #FFE0B2
state PublishedExact #C8E6C9
state PublishedApproximate #FFF9C4
state PublishedIncomplete #FFCCBC
state Rejected #FFCDD2

Uncaptured --> Captured : capture five-coordinate index
Captured --> Analyzed : produce report + digest\nprecision + completeness
Analyzed --> Guaranteed : attach trusted guarantee\nwith verifier relation

Guaranteed --> Rejected : stale subject, snapshot,\nconfiguration, tool, or environment
Guaranteed --> Rejected : digest mismatch, untrusted,\ndependent, or self-confirmed
Guaranteed --> PublishedIncomplete : incomplete coverage
Guaranteed --> PublishedApproximate : approximate precision\nwith complete coverage
Guaranteed --> PublishedExact : exact + complete + fresh\nbound + trusted + independent

PublishedExact --> [*]
PublishedApproximate --> [*]
PublishedIncomplete --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]

note right of Captured
  Captured fields are immutable.
  A later request change makes
  the report stale; it does not
  rewrite the capture.
end note

note right of PublishedExact
  Distinct actor names alone
  do not prove independence.
end note

legend right
  |<#BBDEFB> immutable capture |
  |<#B3E5FC> candidate analysis |
  |<#FFE0B2> assurance validation |
  |<#C8E6C9> exact publication |
  |<#FFF9C4> approximate publication |
  |<#FFCCBC> incomplete publication |
  |<#FFCDD2> rejection |
endlegend
@enduml
